  "statuteText": "354-A:27 Opportunity for Public Education Without Discrimination a Civil Right. –\n\nNo person shall be excluded from participation in, denied the benefits of, or be subjected to discrimination in public schools because of their age, sex, gender identity, sexual orientation, race, color, marital status, familial status, disability, religion or national origin, all as defined in this chapter."
